    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bonus action, you can equip or unequip these night vision goggles. While wearing these goggles, you have darkvision out to a range of 60 feet, and you have disadvantage on attack rolls and Wisdom(Perception) checks that rely on sight when you, the target of the attack, or whatever you are trying to perceive is in brightlight.</p>",
